### Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin123

### Current user
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth/me

### Create teacher
POST http://localhost:8081/api/teachers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Dr. Rahman","email":"rahman@kuet.ac.bd","username":"teacher1","password":"teach123","department":"CSE","designation":"Professor"}

### Create student
POST http://localhost:8081/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Prottoy","email":"prottoy@stud.kuet.ac.bd","username":"student1","password":"stud123","roll":"2207040","department":"CSE","batch":2022}

### Create admin
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admins
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Second Admin","email":"admin2@kuet.ac.bd","username":"admin2","password":"admin456"}

### List students
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students

### Get student
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students/1

### Update student
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Prottoy Kumar Bhoumik","email":"prottoy@stud.kuet.ac.bd","username":"student1","roll":"2207040","department":"CSE","batch":2022}

### Delete teacher
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/teachers/1

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/logout

### RBAC check: teacher accessing students -> 403
GET http://localhost:8081/api/students
Authorization: Basic teacher1 teach123
